<h1>Seven practices. Each one stands alone.</h1>
<p class="lead">Your technology, designed, built and run by one team. Buy one practice, buy all seven — none requires the others. Every practice has its own page, and every service inside it has its own page, with what it is, who it is for, what you get, how it works, what it costs, and the questions people ask before they buy.</p>
<p style="max-width:760px"><strong>Ongoing services, one-off projects and staffing are three different things.</strong> Ongoing services are monthly — somebody is responsible on a Tuesday afternoon when nothing is on fire. Projects have a beginning and an end, and are scoped and priced as projects. Staffing is a person, for a fixed period. They are billed differently, they start and stop differently, and you can buy any one without the others.</p>
